人工智能安全中的五个具体研究问题：避免副作用、避免奖励黑客、可扩展监督、安全探索和分布偏移。"},{"id":"dario-1512.02595","sourceId":"dario","sourceName":"达里奥·阿莫迪 · Baidu","title":"Deep Speech 2: End-to-End Speech Recognition in English and Mandarin","titleZh":"Deep Speech 2：英语和普通话的端到端语音识别","published":"2015-12-08T00:00:00.000Z","publishedTs":1449532800000,"link":"https://aipaper.jasonlin.tech/p/dario-1512.02595/","image":"https://figs.jasonlin.tech/92b322c3ab2570a7.webp","summary":"End-to-end deep learning achieves competitive speech recognition in English and Mandarin, accelerated by HPC techniques.","summaryZh":"端到端深度学习在英语和普通话语音识别上达到竞争性水平，并通过高性能计算技术实现加速。"}]}